  "description": "Moments before victory, dark mage Kai Austin is betrayed and loses everything. His death becomes a reset, sending him five years into the past—to the day of the class assignment ceremony—with all of his magic intact. Armed with max-level dark magic and every memory of the future, Kai refuses to let history repeat itself. This time, he will protect Colette, stop the coming disasters before they beg...\n\nتابع أحداث وتطورات Kiraware <Kokuma Jutsushi> no Yarinaoshi مع تحديثات يومية وتجربة قراءة فائقة السلاسة وبدقة عالية حصرياً على موقع مانجا تايم (MangaTime).",
